WEBVTT

00:25.025 --> 00:26.067
What I have to do,

00:28.236 --> 00:30.655
I have to catch everybody…

00:32.907 --> 00:34.868
if they start to go over the cliff.

00:36.619 --> 00:41.041
I mean, if they're running
and don't look where they're going…

00:45.336 --> 00:46.421
I have to come out

00:48.131 --> 00:50.091
from somewhere…

00:52.635 --> 00:54.929
and catch them.

01:06.066 --> 01:09.360
That's all I'd do all day.

01:39.891 --> 01:45.063
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

02:48.209 --> 02:49.878
You're a total lunatic.

02:54.215 --> 02:56.759
You should understand me, Si-eun.

03:32.128 --> 03:34.672
Why do you think you can't sleep well?

03:37.926 --> 03:40.136
You said you keep having the same dream.

03:42.055 --> 03:46.100
But you still don't want to tell me
what the dream is about?

03:51.231 --> 03:53.107
A dream is just a dream.

04:02.033 --> 04:03.701
Do the sleeping pills help?

04:06.913 --> 04:07.789
Yes.

04:10.041 --> 04:11.459
It doesn't seem like it.

04:15.380 --> 04:18.675
But I'll tell your mother that they do.

04:20.760 --> 04:21.719
Doctor.

04:23.179 --> 04:24.013
Yes?

04:26.599 --> 04:28.518
I think our time is up.

05:25.366 --> 05:28.202
Look, I'll really kick it this time.

05:33.249 --> 05:34.417
Are you okay?

05:36.669 --> 05:38.713
Hey, what is it? This is crazy.

05:41.299 --> 05:42.550
Hey, Yeon Si-eun.

05:43.426 --> 05:45.636
Hey, move out of his way.

05:51.851 --> 05:52.685
What was that?

05:54.520 --> 05:57.023
I heard he transferred here
after killing a kid.

05:58.775 --> 06:01.736
Even Choi Hyo-man chickened out.
He avoids him now.

06:04.113 --> 06:06.449
He must be a fucking psychopath.

06:07.116 --> 06:08.242
Hey, damn.

06:09.494 --> 06:10.370
Yeon Si-eun.

06:12.038 --> 06:14.749
Damn, be quiet!
Someone might get killed again.

06:15.333 --> 06:16.959
Hey, let's go for a smoke.

06:18.002 --> 06:20.213
Fuck this. It's too scary.

06:21.381 --> 06:26.302
"I'D JUST BE
THE CATCHER IN THE RYE AND ALL."

06:26.386 --> 06:29.639
THE CATCHER IN THE RYE
BY J.D. SALINGER

06:37.397 --> 06:39.232
Jun-tae is totally fucked now.

06:42.151 --> 06:43.319
I'm sorry.

06:45.154 --> 06:47.657
I wasn't paying attention.
It was an accident.

07:05.633 --> 07:08.386
Another delivery, Jun-tae? You're busy.

07:37.415 --> 07:39.500
Fuck! Seo Jun-Tae!

07:40.084 --> 07:40.918
Yes?

07:43.504 --> 07:46.174
I asked for strawberry milk.

07:47.175 --> 07:48.009
What?

07:48.926 --> 07:49.886
You bitch.

07:50.636 --> 07:53.890
I told you last week to switch it up!

07:54.974 --> 07:55.808
Right.

08:00.438 --> 08:01.272
Strawberry.

08:04.484 --> 08:05.776
What's with that look?

08:09.071 --> 08:10.031
Is it that hard?

08:11.949 --> 08:14.785
Sorry, I got confused for a second.

08:15.828 --> 08:17.497
I'll let it go just this once.

08:18.915 --> 08:19.749
Got it?

08:21.626 --> 08:22.460
Bring it in.

08:24.045 --> 08:26.506
Sorry. I'll pay more attention next time.

08:26.589 --> 08:27.548
That's it.

08:28.299 --> 08:29.800
Bring me the goods later.

08:32.053 --> 08:32.887
iPhones.

08:34.013 --> 08:34.847
iPhones.

08:35.515 --> 08:36.349
Beat it.

08:39.018 --> 08:40.228
Go, fast delivery!

08:40.311 --> 08:41.354
Go, Jun-tae!

09:02.542 --> 09:06.629
11TH GRADE, CLASS 4 PHONE COLLECTION TABLE

09:11.050 --> 09:12.134
YEON SI-EUN

09:12.218 --> 09:13.344
"Yeon Si-eun."

09:16.138 --> 09:18.724
TRANSFERRED LAST YEAR, DON'T TOUCH

09:43.207 --> 09:44.041
Yeon Si-eun.

09:47.587 --> 09:48.504
Hey…

09:50.631 --> 09:52.967
What kind of phone do you have?

09:54.719 --> 09:55.553
What?

09:56.512 --> 09:58.472
Well, I mean…

09:59.181 --> 10:04.145
I was wondering if you could tell me
the model of your phone.

10:06.105 --> 10:06.939
Why?

10:09.567 --> 10:11.027
I'm just curious…

10:19.535 --> 10:22.538
WELCOME TO THE WORLD OF GO
EUNJANG BOARDROOM

10:23.873 --> 10:25.583
Fuck, is that all?

10:29.545 --> 10:32.965
The supply keeps shrinking, doesn't it?

10:37.261 --> 10:38.596
Fuck.

10:43.392 --> 10:48.230
Gentlemen, it seems that
there is a misunderstanding.

10:48.314 --> 10:52.109
Okay? We're running a business here.

10:52.193 --> 10:53.569
A business, yeah?

10:54.111 --> 10:58.074
You all need to work your asses off
so I can protect your asses

10:59.575 --> 11:00.868
here at Eunjang High.

11:02.119 --> 11:03.287
However,

11:03.788 --> 11:07.500
if your performance
keeps fucking dropping,

11:07.583 --> 11:10.419
I can't protect you guys
from being bullied.

11:11.337 --> 11:15.383
Team Leader, sir, can we have a look
at the ledger for today?

11:15.466 --> 11:19.220
If you missed even one,
I'll beat you all to death today.

11:20.888 --> 11:22.682
- The ledger.
- Five. Four.

11:23.265 --> 11:25.101
Three. Two.

11:26.727 --> 11:28.270
Well,

11:28.771 --> 11:32.316
Team Leader, sir,
this looks very significant.

11:32.900 --> 11:33.776
What does?

11:34.276 --> 11:36.028
I mean, look here.

11:36.654 --> 11:38.823
"Class 4, Yeon Si-eun. Don't touch."

11:38.906 --> 11:40.366
Don't touch?

11:42.201 --> 11:43.119
Why is that?

11:43.786 --> 11:46.664
Well, the thing is,

11:47.456 --> 11:50.501
when he transferred here,

11:50.584 --> 11:53.295
you two almost got into a fight,

11:53.379 --> 11:55.548
but the teacher walked in,
and that was it.

11:55.631 --> 12:00.511
Then you said you'd handle him yourself,
and we shouldn't touch him.

12:00.594 --> 12:01.554
Get to the point.

12:01.637 --> 12:03.222
Yes, well, so…

12:03.723 --> 12:07.393
You haven't taken
any action against him yet.

12:07.476 --> 12:11.063
I thought if I took action myself,
it could cause a problem--

12:11.147 --> 12:12.106
A problem?

12:12.857 --> 12:14.942
- A problem, he says?
- Crazy asshole.

12:15.443 --> 12:16.485
A problem?

12:17.862 --> 12:20.281
That dumbass is really pushing
the wrong buttons.

12:23.367 --> 12:25.494
- What kind of problem?
- It's not that.

12:25.578 --> 12:27.621
When you say "problem" like that,

12:28.497 --> 12:31.125
you mean you think
that prick would beat me?

12:31.208 --> 12:32.334
- Is that it?
- No.

12:32.418 --> 12:33.878
Don't fucking deny it!

12:34.545 --> 12:35.588
You can guard?

12:36.213 --> 12:38.841
Fuck, that was cool. Do it again.

12:43.220 --> 12:44.054
Hold still.

12:48.684 --> 12:50.561
That's what you thought this whole time?

12:50.644 --> 12:52.688
That I'd lose? You fucking asshole.

12:52.772 --> 12:55.441
Is that right? Huh?

12:58.402 --> 12:59.236
Get up.

12:59.779 --> 13:00.613
Yeah?

13:05.409 --> 13:08.329
Look at this fucking kid.
He looks like a beggar.

13:08.412 --> 13:11.248
You need to look sharp.
Fuck. Who did this to you?

13:15.252 --> 13:16.212
Hi-yah!

13:19.632 --> 13:20.841
Oh shit!

13:25.429 --> 13:26.347
Team Leader.

13:29.308 --> 13:33.020
I know you'll have Si-eun's phone
by the end of the day.

13:33.813 --> 13:34.647
I will.

13:35.314 --> 13:36.857
Good. Thank you.

13:47.535 --> 13:48.869
Sir, the phones.

13:49.495 --> 13:52.122
No announcements today,
so you can take them.

13:52.790 --> 13:53.874
See you tomorrow.

13:53.958 --> 13:55.042
Yes, see you.

13:59.255 --> 14:00.589
It can't be helped.

14:05.719 --> 14:07.346
This can't be helped.

14:26.073 --> 14:30.995
12 - YEON SI-EUN

14:39.211 --> 14:41.505
Get your phones. No announcements today.

15:03.152 --> 15:03.986
Hey.

15:05.571 --> 15:06.614
Yeah?

15:07.364 --> 15:08.449
Have you seen my phone?

15:11.493 --> 15:12.745
It's not there?

15:14.455 --> 15:15.289
It's not.

15:17.708 --> 15:19.251
Oh? Really?

15:19.835 --> 15:21.962
That's really weird.

15:22.755 --> 15:24.757
I mean,

15:24.840 --> 15:26.300
how could this happen?

15:26.800 --> 15:27.801
It's really gone.

15:29.762 --> 15:30.888
Well, that's…

15:30.971 --> 15:34.892
I just got them from the office.

15:34.975 --> 15:37.895
I don't hand them out. You saw.
Everyone just takes theirs.

15:37.978 --> 15:41.065
I don't touch
or go through anyone's phones.

15:41.148 --> 15:43.609
There's no way I would steal one.

15:44.109 --> 15:46.111
I'm not a thief or anything.

15:47.780 --> 15:48.614
Yeah.

15:49.406 --> 15:50.908
You know what I'm saying?

15:54.536 --> 15:56.163
I don't know what you're saying.

16:00.584 --> 16:02.419
Anyway, I really don't know.

16:02.503 --> 16:03.504
Okay.

16:14.598 --> 16:16.517
Here's Yeon Si-eun's phone.

16:16.600 --> 16:18.352
As expected, Team Leader.

16:18.435 --> 16:22.606
Why did you wait to get told off?
You should've done this first.

16:23.232 --> 16:25.567
You can clock out.
I'll pass the phone to Hyo-man.

16:26.443 --> 16:28.404
- Okay.
- Get home safe, Jun-tae.

16:28.487 --> 16:29.321
Thanks.

16:30.823 --> 16:31.699
Take care.

16:33.242 --> 16:34.493
I love you, Jun-tae.

16:48.924 --> 16:51.093
Si-eun, did you find your phone?

17:07.484 --> 17:08.318
Hey.

17:09.069 --> 17:10.529
About your phone.

17:10.612 --> 17:12.072
I thought about it.

17:13.032 --> 17:15.826
I feel bad

17:15.909 --> 17:20.122
because I'm partly responsible
for not looking after them well.

17:20.205 --> 17:23.292
So if you plan on buying a new phone,

17:23.876 --> 17:25.627
I'll pitch in some money.

17:26.462 --> 17:29.214
This is the time to remain positive.

17:29.298 --> 17:31.425
You just need to push forward.

17:31.508 --> 17:34.595
In life, there are always things
that can't be helped.

17:34.678 --> 17:36.055
What can't be helped?

17:39.099 --> 17:40.893
Do you think I don't know?

17:43.771 --> 17:46.148
You're just trying
to make yourself feel better.

17:51.153 --> 17:53.322
That's really cowardly.

18:09.797 --> 18:10.923
Cowardly?

18:14.343 --> 18:15.177
Si-eun.

18:15.844 --> 18:18.597
You didn't lose your phone on purpose
just to get a new one?

18:22.643 --> 18:24.103
It's nice anyway.

18:25.145 --> 18:26.980
I get to hang out with my son.

18:29.566 --> 18:33.946
When you study abroad next semester,
we won't have much time together.

18:36.406 --> 18:40.035
It could be tough at first,
but you'll soon get used to it.

18:57.219 --> 18:58.053
Su-ho.

19:01.515 --> 19:03.100
I still can't sleep.

19:06.019 --> 19:07.563
I take sleeping pills,

19:09.273 --> 19:10.774
but I still can't sleep.

19:15.362 --> 19:17.406
While I can't sleep…

19:20.534 --> 19:22.536
I wonder when you'll wake up.

19:26.790 --> 19:27.875
A few days ago,

19:29.543 --> 19:32.087
I called one of my classmates cowardly.

19:34.548 --> 19:35.424
However…

19:38.969 --> 19:41.555
I actually might be the cowardly one.

19:44.683 --> 19:46.018
I wish…

19:48.020 --> 19:50.355
everyone would leave me alone.

19:53.442 --> 19:54.443
As if…

19:56.111 --> 19:57.321
I wasn't there.

20:04.328 --> 20:05.454
Let's just go.

20:06.788 --> 20:10.584
- Why's he doing that on the stairs?
- You did a good job.

20:10.667 --> 20:13.045
You're a real cutie, aren't you?

20:13.128 --> 20:15.088
That's it. Hug me tightly.

20:15.172 --> 20:17.758
My dear Jun-tae, how about a blind date?

20:18.258 --> 20:20.719
Yeah, why don't you drink with us?

20:20.802 --> 20:23.889
Good idea. Jun-tae has
a fucking huge one, you know.

20:23.972 --> 20:24.932
Is that so?

20:25.557 --> 20:28.310
Goodness! Our Jun-tae has a big one?

20:28.393 --> 20:29.353
No way.

20:29.436 --> 20:31.104
Let me feel that dick, okay?

20:31.188 --> 20:32.481
Come here.

20:32.564 --> 20:34.066
- Come on, man!
- Stop it!

20:34.149 --> 20:35.192
Aren't we friends?

20:35.275 --> 20:37.361
- Damn.
- Don't do that!

20:40.739 --> 20:42.074
Hey, don't move!

20:42.157 --> 20:43.492
Hey, don't try too hard.

20:43.575 --> 20:45.369
Fucker, stay still!

20:45.953 --> 20:47.871
Hold still. Look at this punk!

20:47.955 --> 20:50.040
- He's blocking him quite well!
- Stop it!

20:51.708 --> 20:52.960
This punk!

20:53.543 --> 20:55.003
- It's gigantic!
- Don't!

20:57.089 --> 20:59.591
- Jun-tae, what are you doing?
- Stop it!

21:19.236 --> 21:20.612
Hey, wait!

21:23.532 --> 21:24.366
Hey, Si-eun.

21:27.202 --> 21:28.036
Hey.

21:29.663 --> 21:30.497
Hey, punk!

21:32.374 --> 21:36.044
Fuck, what are you doing standing there?
You're fucking scary.

21:40.007 --> 21:42.050
Hey, I heard you lost your phone.

21:42.134 --> 21:45.887
Phones go missing a lot these days.
Take good care of yours. Right, Jun-tae?

21:46.763 --> 21:47.764
Yeah.

21:47.848 --> 21:50.017
I have a lot of extras. Do you want one?

21:50.517 --> 21:52.060
Say "please."

21:55.772 --> 21:58.150
Move it. Get out of my way.

22:06.033 --> 22:07.034
I don't want to.

22:17.586 --> 22:18.837
His eyes might pop out.

22:18.920 --> 22:20.422
Man, go on.

22:20.505 --> 22:22.841
Hey, move over for him. Go.

22:32.517 --> 22:34.436
Wow, look at that fucker's eyes.

22:35.270 --> 22:36.897
You're letting him go?

22:36.980 --> 22:39.232
Man, just leave the fucking loser alone.

22:52.996 --> 22:53.914
Sorry.

22:56.166 --> 22:57.834
I didn't mean to wake you.

23:00.253 --> 23:01.088
I'm sorry.

23:07.135 --> 23:07.969
Well…

23:08.887 --> 23:10.472
Those are for you

23:11.348 --> 23:13.517
because you sleep through lunch every day.

23:13.600 --> 23:15.352
Take them. I don't need them.

23:17.854 --> 23:18.939
Hey, I just…

23:24.945 --> 23:25.862
I'm sorry.

23:27.197 --> 23:29.408
I took your phone and gave it to Hyo-man.

23:33.829 --> 23:34.830
I'm sorry,

23:36.415 --> 23:38.291
but I really couldn't help it.

23:41.753 --> 23:42.587
Yeon Si-eun.

23:55.100 --> 23:56.435
Last time, you said…

23:58.645 --> 24:00.355
that I was being cowardly.

24:02.566 --> 24:04.901
I've thought a lot about it since then.

24:08.321 --> 24:11.199
But I really don't know what I should do.

24:13.326 --> 24:14.161
So?

24:18.874 --> 24:20.333
Can you tell me?

24:26.673 --> 24:29.217
How can I stop being a coward?

24:33.388 --> 24:34.222
Why me?

24:36.808 --> 24:39.352
There's no one else I can ask.

24:42.939 --> 24:43.857
Please.

24:50.864 --> 24:52.699
Do you know Newton's third law?

24:55.911 --> 24:57.287
Without an action,

24:58.371 --> 24:59.956
there won't be a reaction.

25:27.901 --> 25:28.985
NEWTON'S LAWS OF MOTION

25:33.198 --> 25:35.033
VICE PRESIDENT

25:48.463 --> 25:49.589
Cheers!

25:50.090 --> 25:52.175
Let's drink!

25:55.887 --> 25:58.515
Hey, Hyo-man. Jun-tae isn't answering.

25:59.015 --> 26:01.434
I heard he left early or something.

26:01.518 --> 26:02.519
No fucking idea.

26:03.228 --> 26:05.605
If Jun-tae doesn't answer, who's paying?

26:05.689 --> 26:07.941
Fuck, and you call yourself men?

26:09.150 --> 26:09.985
What's that?

26:11.194 --> 26:12.195
What's what?

26:15.073 --> 26:15.907
Fucking cool!

26:15.991 --> 26:17.325
What a man!

26:17.909 --> 26:20.662
I need to step out for a minute,
but keep partying.

26:20.745 --> 26:21.621
I'm off.

26:22.122 --> 26:24.583
- Where are you going?
- It's business.

26:24.666 --> 26:26.418
- Isn't this great?
- Have fun.

26:26.918 --> 26:28.878
- I'll take care of your girl.
- Fuck you.

26:28.962 --> 26:30.088
Where's he going?

26:32.424 --> 26:34.759
We're trying to join the Union.

26:34.843 --> 26:37.679
If we do, we'll make a shitload of money.

26:44.936 --> 26:47.230
Fuck! Why don't you fucking get it?

26:47.981 --> 26:50.650
You go to Eunjang High,
so know your place and listen up.

26:50.734 --> 26:52.027
Stop looking like that.

26:52.527 --> 26:54.154
You fucking morons.

26:56.698 --> 26:58.325
- Wow, he's loaded.
- A rich kid?

26:58.408 --> 26:59.326
So fucking loaded.

27:00.535 --> 27:01.411
Hey.

27:02.495 --> 27:03.580
Does this suck?

27:03.663 --> 27:05.915
If it fucking sucks, join the Union.

27:06.791 --> 27:10.211
You fucking idiots live like this
because you go to Eunjang.

27:10.295 --> 27:11.421
Get it together.

27:11.921 --> 27:13.798
Fuck, I'd have transferred if I was you.

27:13.882 --> 27:15.759
Don't look like that.

27:19.638 --> 27:20.472
What is it?

27:21.014 --> 27:22.307
Is Seong-je inside?

27:23.642 --> 27:24.684
What?

27:25.268 --> 27:27.270
I'm Choi Hyo-man from Eunjang.

27:27.354 --> 27:29.939
I have a meeting with Seong-je.
Is he around?

27:30.899 --> 27:32.108
- Right.
- He's here.

27:32.942 --> 27:34.611
Yes, Seong-je is inside.

27:34.694 --> 27:35.779
Thank you!

27:36.821 --> 27:37.697
Hey.

27:40.325 --> 27:41.701
Enjoy it while you can.

27:46.164 --> 27:48.375
What? Is Eunjang really joining the Union?

27:48.875 --> 27:50.710
Isn't Baku the top dog at Eunjang?

27:51.211 --> 27:52.295
What's that punk up to?

28:00.095 --> 28:02.430
Okay, I'll bring more next month.

28:03.306 --> 28:04.307
Okay, beat it.

28:12.774 --> 28:13.900
DAEHYEON HIGH, GANGHAK HIGH

28:13.983 --> 28:15.235
Man, that's a lot.

28:18.947 --> 28:20.657
Seong-je. It's me, Hyo-man.

28:22.742 --> 28:23.576
Are you gaming?

28:24.077 --> 28:25.120
Fucking idiots.

28:26.454 --> 28:27.914
I said to just draw aggro.

28:28.790 --> 28:30.333
Sorry, my bad.

28:31.501 --> 28:34.587
This is why
I don't go on raids with newbies.

28:37.674 --> 28:38.550
Speak.

28:39.342 --> 28:41.803
It's about the phones.

28:41.886 --> 28:44.848
I need until next week to get some more.

28:44.931 --> 28:49.728
But if you can overlook that,
I think I can really bring in some profit.

28:50.437 --> 28:51.855
And as we said,

28:52.439 --> 28:56.234
if you could take care of Park Hu-min
when he's off suspension…

28:56.943 --> 28:57.986
Next week?

28:58.069 --> 29:01.322
Yeah, I'll definitely have
100 phones by next week.

29:01.990 --> 29:05.118
I usually don't make mistakes like this.

29:05.201 --> 29:06.327
Man!

29:06.411 --> 29:08.163
Have the goods by next week.

29:08.246 --> 29:11.040
Of course! You know I'm loyal.

29:11.541 --> 29:13.668
These brats are playing gangsters.

29:13.752 --> 29:15.378
How fucking scary.

29:16.588 --> 29:19.048
These little shits deserve a beating.

29:21.009 --> 29:23.136
What, is he a Gen Z gangster?

29:23.636 --> 29:24.637
Fucking Gen Z.

29:28.516 --> 29:31.019
What the hell? What the fuck do you want?

29:46.534 --> 29:47.410
Fuck.

29:54.876 --> 29:56.878
Seong-je. You're very busy. Sorry.

29:58.087 --> 29:59.005
I'll get going.

30:02.884 --> 30:04.385
Who the hell was that?

30:11.935 --> 30:16.523
PRESIDENT CHOI

30:16.606 --> 30:18.274
MISSED CALL: PRESIDENT CHOI

30:18.358 --> 30:20.860
VICE PRESIDENT:
LOST YOUR MIND? YOU'RE DEAD

30:20.944 --> 30:22.153
CHOI: SEE YOU TOMORROW LOL

30:56.771 --> 30:58.314
Newton's third law.

30:59.858 --> 31:01.276
For every action,

31:02.735 --> 31:04.112
there is a reaction

31:05.154 --> 31:08.116
with equivalent force
in the opposite direction.

31:56.539 --> 31:57.498
Im Han-ul.

31:57.582 --> 31:59.459
CLASS 1, IM HAN-UL
I'M SORRY, LOOK INSIDE

32:01.461 --> 32:03.046
Kwon Ju…

32:05.006 --> 32:05.882
Kwon Ju-ho.

32:07.884 --> 32:08.843
Song Gi-wan…

32:10.053 --> 32:11.262
Song Gi-wan.

32:14.599 --> 32:17.185
Baek Seung-u. Do Jae-gyeong.

32:20.146 --> 32:20.980
Mo Il-yeong.

32:21.481 --> 32:22.523
Hong Seong-gwan.

32:23.024 --> 32:24.067
Seo Jong-ho.

32:24.150 --> 32:26.694
Kwak Byeong-min. Kim Hun-yeong.

32:27.612 --> 32:28.613
Kim Jun-su.

32:32.158 --> 32:35.536
11TH GRADE, CLASS 4
12 - YEON SI-EUN

32:53.471 --> 32:55.723
You're overreacting, dumbass.

32:55.807 --> 32:58.101
Let me see your phone.
You said you got it back.

32:58.601 --> 33:00.770
Look here. Is this your phone?

33:00.853 --> 33:02.480
It's mine, you fucking idiot.

33:02.563 --> 33:04.607
- You're right.
- Jun-tae has gone crazy!

33:05.108 --> 33:07.777
Why's that traitor acting
like he's on our side?

33:07.860 --> 33:11.406
What's important is
he gave everyone's phones back.

33:11.489 --> 33:12.740
Maybe he'll transfer.

33:12.824 --> 33:14.158
Is Hyo-man here yet?

33:14.659 --> 33:16.995
He's brutal when he loses his shit.

33:17.078 --> 33:18.746
Jun-tae is dead. Seriously.

33:29.382 --> 33:32.927
CLASS 4, YEON SI-EUN
I'M SORRY, LOOK INSIDE, THANK YOU

33:55.616 --> 33:56.576
Who did this?

34:04.083 --> 34:06.669
Answer me, you fucking assholes. Who?

34:10.298 --> 34:13.426
Seo Jun-tae.
He went to every class this morning.

34:27.440 --> 34:28.941
Move it, you assholes!

34:38.785 --> 34:40.203
Seo Jun-tae!

34:46.876 --> 34:48.377
Where is that asshole?

34:49.629 --> 34:50.463
There.

34:52.965 --> 34:55.676
For every good action,
a good reaction follows.

34:57.303 --> 35:00.014
For every good action,
a good reaction follows.

35:01.641 --> 35:02.475
Jun-tae.

35:02.558 --> 35:05.269
For every good action,
a good reaction follows.

35:05.937 --> 35:07.105
Get over here.

35:18.533 --> 35:19.659
Then I'll come to you.

35:22.912 --> 35:23.746
Fucking asshole!

35:27.250 --> 35:28.084
Hey.

35:29.460 --> 35:30.711
Is it true?

35:31.712 --> 35:33.589
You took the phones?

35:36.884 --> 35:37.718
Yeah.

35:39.679 --> 35:40.930
Aren't you cool?

35:48.604 --> 35:50.439
Your guard is fucking tough!

35:50.523 --> 35:53.276
Hey, you're looking good. Give it to me.

35:54.277 --> 35:55.862
Fuck. Let it go.

35:55.945 --> 35:58.156
Are you a dancing machine or what?

36:01.742 --> 36:03.327
Block this, too, will you?

36:04.162 --> 36:05.329
Nice shot!

36:09.709 --> 36:11.586
A pancake mouth guard!

36:20.011 --> 36:22.180
You should be obeying me like a dog.

36:23.931 --> 36:26.225
Thanks to me,
you had an easy time at school.

36:26.809 --> 36:28.936
Should I make you kill yourself, fucker?

36:30.354 --> 36:33.065
You son of a bitch!

36:33.149 --> 36:37.778
Hey, you piece of shit! Fucking asshole!

36:39.739 --> 36:43.701
No matter what you fucking do,
nothing will fucking change, asshole!

36:47.205 --> 36:48.206
You son of a bitch!

37:30.331 --> 37:31.582
Hey, should we stop him?

37:31.666 --> 37:32.667
Team Leader, sir?

37:32.750 --> 37:34.460
- Stay out of it.
- We're almost done.

37:44.637 --> 37:45.805
You're too loud.

37:49.267 --> 37:50.142
What?

37:55.523 --> 37:56.941
Don't cross the line.

41:57.890 --> 42:01.810
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
